{
  "_comment": "Coral Edge TPU artifact manifest (Coral design D7). Every file comes from the google-coral/test_data repository (Apache-2.0) at its default branch and is fetched by fetch-models.sh, which resolves the branch tip at run time, reads each file's publisher digest (the git blob id the GitHub API reports) and refuses bytes that do not match it. The digest it verified, the size, the source and the time are recorded per file in models.installed.json beside the weights; the sidecar re-checks a file against that record before it loads it (a drifted file is a structured model_sha_mismatch, never a silent load; a file with no record is served and reported as unverified).",
